  (text "POWER\nControlboard +3V3 (VIN1, via J2) is used whenever present. USB (VIN2) powers the board for standalone flashing.\nThe TPS2116 blocks reverse current, so USB never back-feeds the controlboard and no output diodes are needed.\nST high = controlboard power selected; firmware reads it on GPIO9 (PWR_SRC_HOST).\nPR1 divider and hysteresis match ControlBoard2027 U2.\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §2."
    (at 152.4 220.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5eb9387f-9536-4f6b-bb69-ffdec9f3423e")
  )
  (text "ROUTING - POWER\nC7 at U3 VIN1, C6 at VIN2, C8/C9 at VOUT. U4 tab to a copper pour.\n+3V3_HOST from J2 to U3 VIN1 and +3V3 to the module with wide traces (650mA peaks)."
    (at 152.4 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1f760402-13bc-4aac-b723-10ead8c7a9e2")
  )
  (text "POWER MUX U3: CONTROLBOARD 3V3, ELSE USB"
    (at 172.72 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "969845bf-893b-4085-a940-27db58e3020b")
  )
  (text "USB 3V3 LDO U4"
    (at 149.86 170.18 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d1a6b058-0d47-4378-8142-28870e58faee")
  )
